97
00:09:58,040 --> 00:10:00,000
Lord Odin.

98
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,880
My lord, I failed him.

99
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:24,520
And thus ends the final
battle of Kozuki Oden,

100
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:28,100
