The daimyo of Kuri,

110
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:22,517
Kozuki Oden, and his nine followers
were imprisoned in the flower capital.

111
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,997
Now labeled criminals,

112
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:28,380
