for rebelling against the shogun.

113
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:33,718
Unaware of the reason for their
arrest, the population reacted coldly.

114
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:35,829
Odin was a disappointment.

115
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,437
It's too little too late.

116
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,837
So we don't even get to
see his asinine dance

117
