178
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:36,680
That's too long even for a normal bath.

179
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:43,480
A fool to the end, I see.

180
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:45,820
Do I have your word?

181
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:47,460
Of course you do.

182
00:16:50,220 --> 00:16:51,691
Please, talk to us first!

183
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,710
Come back!

184
00:16:53,620 --> 00:16:54,900
Please, we beg you!

185
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:12,740
He survived!

186
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,281
Do not let him suffer on his own!

187
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,980
We must follow our Lord.

188
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:26,900
We shall meet again in the
next world. Farewell! Great!

189
00:17:33,180 --> 00:17:34,360
Stay back!

190
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,981
Balance yourselves on this plank!

191
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:39,440
All of you!

192
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:45,690
Lord!

193
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:53,520
What are you doing, my lord? Stop!

194
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:04,360
We're ready to die!

195
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:05,540
Please, my lord!

196
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,280
This is cruel!

197
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:14,114
It's a disgrace to live on without you!

198
00:18:15,140 --> 00:18:17,552
My lord, we should be holding you, Garam!

199
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:18,877
Please, switch with me!

200
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,957
You should allow me to go in your stead!

201
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:22,220
Please, Lord Odin!

202
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:26,020
