Well, I have to hand it to him.

209
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,860
All ten are in the pot.

210
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,800
Clever, Odin.

211
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:56,520
Fair enough.

212
00:19:01,340 --> 00:19:04,120
All right, let's start the clock.

213
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:11,220
This isn't fair.

214
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:15,240
Please, my lord, let us down!

215
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,700
Think you'll last.

216
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:26,100
It has been a bit of a minute yet.

217
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:35,200
He's still standing.

218
00:19:35,620 --> 00:19:36,820
His skin is tough.

219
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,100
I fear I may faint from this heat alone.

220
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,220
I can't take it.

221
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:50,200
You gotta have no right to
complain, so suck it up, Race.

222
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:51,440
Sit still.

223
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:53,160
You gotta have it easy.

224
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:56,220
Stop your wiggling, cat.

225
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,560
We have to stay balanced up here.

226
